    {
      "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:684a44dc0aa851133f2f91069da75e2dd4816d4b17de846a1a3797c8df66e947",
      "@type": "Class",
      "apDefinition": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Object waarop of waarlangs zich verkeer voordoet of dat deel uitmaakt vh verkeer."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Object on which or along which traffic occurs or that is part of traffic."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Object on which or along which traffic occurs or that is part of traffic."
        }
      ],
      "apLabel": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Verkeersobject"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "TrafficObject"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "TrafficObject"
        }
      ],
      "apUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "OPGELET: Deze klasse is abstract, ze moet gespecialiseerd worden als Verkeersdomeinobject of als Verkeersbemonsteringsobject. Als Verkeersdomeinobject als de meting direct betrekking heeft op het object dat men wil observeren (bvb een Wegsegment of een Voertuig etc) of als Verkeersbemonsteringsobject als de meting onrechtstreeks gebeurt (bvb via een Verkeersmeetpunt gelegen langs een Wegsegment)."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "ATTENTION: This class is abstract, it must be specialized as a TrafficDomainObject or as a TrafficSamplingObject. As a Traffic DomainObject if the measurement directly relates to the object you want to observe (e.g. a RoadSegment or a Vehicle, etc.) or as a TrafficSamplingObject if the measurement is done indirectly (e.g. via a TrafficMeasuringPoint located along a RoadSegment)."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "ATTENTION: This class is abstract, it must be specialized as a TrafficDomainObject or as a TrafficSamplingObject. As a Traffic DomainObject if the measurement directly relates to the object you want to observe (e.g. a RoadSegment or a Vehicle, etc.) or as a TrafficSamplingObject if the measurement is done indirectly (e.g. via a TrafficMeasuringPoint located along a RoadSegment)."
        }
      ],
      "assignedURI": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/verkeersmetingen#Verkeersobject",
      "diagramLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Verkeersobject"
        }
