        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "SamplingCurve"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "SamplingCurve"
        }
      ],
      "apUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Van het Object dat men wil observeren wordt in dat geval een representatief lijnvormig deel beschouwd. Voorbeelden zijn trajecten, boorgaten, profielen, intervallen etc. Dikwijls specialiseert de Curve zich tot Lijnstring. OPMERKING: Meer info over deze klasse in het applicatieprofiel <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/observaties-en-metingen/\">OSLO Observaties en Metingen</a> ."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "In that case, a representative linear part is considered of the Object that one wants to observe. Examples are routes, boreholes, profiles, intervals, etc. The Curve often specializes in a LineString. REMARK: More info about these class in the application profile <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/observaties-en-metingen/\">OSLO Observations and Measurements</a> ."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "In that case, a representative linear part is considered of the Object that one wants to observe. Examples are routes, boreholes, profiles, intervals, etc. The Curve often specializes in a LineString. REMARK: More info about these class in the application profile <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/observaties-en-metingen/\">OSLO Observations and Measurements</a> ."
        }
      ],
      "assignedURI": "http://def.isotc211.org/iso19156/2011/SamplingCurve#SF_SamplingCurve",
